category: Text
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libicu76 liblttoolbox3 libstdc++6 python312
sdesc: "Finite state compiler, processor and helper tools used by apertium (python312 bindings)"
ldesc: "lttoolbox contains finite state tools for lexical processing, morphological
analysis and generation of words. Analysis is the process of splitting a word
like cats into its lemma cat and the grammatical information <n><pl>.
Generation is the opposite process."
external-source: lttoolbox

